OL,3,GNEWSA'Dockless bike crisis' sparks
OL,4,Aparking zones plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FTower Hamlets Council is considering
OL,7,Fdesignated parking zones for dockless
OL,8,Fbikes after a petition highlighted what
OL,9,Fcampaigners called the borough's
OL,10,F"dockless bikes crisis".
OL,12,FThe petition said locals were not
OL,13,Fopposed to cycling, but to bikes
OL,14,Fcreating hazards on pavements -
OL,15,Fparticularly on the "narrow and
OL,16,Fcongested pavements around Brick Lane"
OL,17,Fin Spitalfields and Shoreditch.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
