OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F324A1791955590
OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Dockless bike crisis' sparks
OL,4,Aparking zones plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FChief executive Stephen Halsey said
OL,7,Fwork on parking zones was under way
OL,8,Ffollowing the call for "swift and
OL,9,Fdecisive action to address the
OL,10,Fproblematic parking".
OL,12,FHalsey said: "The options that are
OL,13,Favailable to the council are to do what
OL,14,FHackney, Islington and other inner
OL,15,FLondon boroughs have done, which is
OL,16,Fhave parking zones."
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
